  <notes><![CDATA[groove v1: a real-time looper of drums (pads, sampled kit) and chords (keys, 4-voice Juno/Prophet-style synth),
with drums generated in 16 styles after apc-chord. groove_ctl (hub, Launchkey 49 MK3) -> groove_drums + groove_synth -> groove_mix
(delay, Elements reverb, click, master). Kit: /kit/NN_name.wav (groove_kit). docs/groove_cheatsheet.pdf documents it.]]></notes>
